isks overflowing the 152-unit capacity around day 14, when 100 units of product 0 arrive.\n3. **Leftovers carry over, but shortages are simply lost.** Because the oldest stock sells first, extra stock acts as a buffer and is used up later. Anything ordered beyond true demand is eventually thrown away, at 12 per unit for product 0 and 7 for product 1. So ordering about 1.2× (candidates 1 and 2) wastes a lot of stock. Ordering 1.0× (candidates 0 and 5) runs short on average, and each lost unit costs 15 for product 0 (margin plus penalty) and 13 for product 1.\n\n**Ranking:**\n- **Most likely in the top half:** 3, then 6.\n- **Probably in the top half, less certain:** 4 and 0.\n- **Close to the boundary:** 7.\n- **Weakest:** 1, 2 and 5.\n\nThe split between 0, 4 and 7 is the least certain part of this ranking."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5050, "cache_read_input_tokens": 886, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 5050}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-29T07:57:42.010Z", "request_id": "req_011CgWAu6kDwzHmX8yaEuDRq"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01De4JGWit9RqJhfuh5tJ5t7", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgWAu6z7p9HPJhp2yp1Mj", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01De4JGWit9RqJhfuh5tJ5t7", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": 